# Production build config for the frontend (Vite).
# VITE_API_URL is the public address of the backend API (Render). It is NOT a
# secret — it gets embedded in the browser bundle regardless — so it is safe to
# commit. Vite loads this file automatically during `vite build`.
# A real environment variable of the same name (e.g. set in a host's build
# settings) still takes precedence over this file, so this is just a reliable
# default so builds never ship without an API URL.
VITE_API_URL=https://ethiodo-api-uco8.onrender.com
